<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#181c21" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
  <meta name="description" content="Aberration turns streaming sensor data into evidence of change. Continuous anomaly detection for connected systems.">
  <title>Aberration — Evidence of change.</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://{{ ingress_base_domain | e }}/">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2064%2064%22%20width%3D%2264%22%20height%3D%2264%22%20role%3D%22img%22%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctitle%3EAberration%3C%2Ftitle%3E%0A%20%20%3Cstyle%3E%3Aroot%7Bcolor%3A%23000%7D%40media%28prefers-color-scheme%3Adark%29%7B%3Aroot%7Bcolor%3A%23fff%7D%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%0A%20%20%3Cpath%20id%3D%22mark%22%20fill%3D%22currentColor%22%20d%3D%22M10%2010H38V20H20V54H10ZM44%2010H54V54H26V44H44Z%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A">
  <style>
    /* Mirror the application tokens in frontend/src/App.css. Keep this page self-contained. */
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --background: 0 0% 100%;
      --foreground: 210 22% 19%;
      --primary: 170 37% 36%;
      --primary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;
      --muted: 220 23% 97%;
      --muted-foreground: 210 10% 44%;
      --accent: 210 21% 95%;
      --border: 210 15% 92%;
      --radius: .5rem;
      background: hsl(var(--background));
      color: hsl(var(--foreground));
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --background: 213 16% 11%;
        --foreground: 207 22% 90%;
        --primary: 164 28% 64%;
        --primary-foreground: 213 16% 11%;
        --muted: 213 19% 9%;
        --muted-foreground: 207 11% 63%;
        --accent: 212 18% 16%;
        --border: 212 13% 19%;
      }
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { min-width: 320px; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid hsl(var(--primary)); outline-offset: 5px; }
    ::selection { background: hsl(var(--primary)); color: hsl(var(--primary-foreground)); }
    .container { width: min(100% - 96px, 1200px); margin-inline: auto; }
    .skip-link { position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 24px; z-index: 2; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius: var(--radius); background: hsl(var(--background)); transform: translateY(-160%); }
    .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
    .site-header { border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
    .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; min-height: 76px; }
    .wordmark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 44px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .brand-mark { display: block; width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #000; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .brand-mark { color: #fff; } }
    .header-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
    .header-link:hover { background: hsl(var(--accent)); }
    .arrow { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
    .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; padding-block: 96px 88px; }
    .eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 26px; color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
    .dot { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(56px, 5.8vw, 80px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -.055em; font-weight: 550; }
    h1 span { display: block; color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .description { max-width: 430px; margin: 26px 0 30px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; }
    .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; background: hsl(var(--primary)); color: hsl(var(--primary-foreground)); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
    .button:hover { background: hsl(var(--primary) / .9); }
    .text-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .text-link:hover { color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
    .hero-note { margin: 24px 0 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 12px; }
    .pattern-figure { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
    .pattern-art { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
    .pattern-field { fill: hsl(var(--primary) / .035); }
    .pattern-contours { fill: none; stroke: hsl(var(--muted-foreground) / .28); stroke-width: 1; }
    .pattern-art path { vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
    .pattern-change { fill: none; stroke: hsl(var(--primary)); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; }
    .pattern-halo { fill: hsl(var(--primary) / .1); }
    .pattern-point { fill: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .pattern-caption { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 4px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 12px; }
    .pattern-caption::before { content: ""; width: 24px; height: 1px; background: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .approach { padding-block: 56px 60px; border-block: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); background: hsl(var(--muted)); scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
    .section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 38px; }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .section-heading > p { margin: 0; max-width: 360px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 14px; }
    .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 48px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .step-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
    .step-number { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 25px; height: 25px; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--primary) / .25); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 10px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    h3 { margin: 18px 0 10px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .steps p { max-width: 330px; margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
    .closing { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; padding-block: 52px; }
    .closing h2 { font-size: 23px; }
    .closing p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .site-footer { border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
    .footer-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding-block: 24px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 12px; }
    .footer-inner p { margin: 0; }
    @media (max-width: 1050px) {
      .container { width: calc(100% - 56px); }
      .hero { gap: 40px; padding-block: 72px; }
      h1 { font-size: 62px; }
      .description { font-size: 16px; }
      .steps { gap: 28px; }
      .section-heading { align-items: flex-start; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .container { width: calc(100% - 40px); }
      .header-inner { min-height: 64px; gap: 12px; }
      .header-link { min-height: 44px; padding-inline: 8px; }
      .hero { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 40px; padding-block: 52px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(52px, 10vw, 72px); }
      .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .description { max-width: 480px; margin-block: 22px 26px; }
      .hero-note { margin-top: 18px; }
      .pattern-figure { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; }
      .approach { padding-block: 40px; }
      .section-heading { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .section-heading > p { max-width: 480px; }
      h2 { font-size: 25px; }
      .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
      .steps li + li { padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
      h3 { margin-top: 12px; }
      .steps p { max-width: 480px; }
      .closing { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding-block: 40px; }
      .footer-inner { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; font-size: 11px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .wordmark { gap: 7px; font-size: 15px; }
      .header-link { gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; }
      .hero-actions { gap: 8px 18px; }
    }
    @media (forced-colors: active) {
      .brand-mark { color: LinkText; }
      .button, .step-number { border: 1px solid ButtonText; }
      .pattern-contours { stroke: CanvasText; }
      .pattern-change { stroke: LinkText; }
      .pattern-point { fill: LinkText; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a class="wordmark" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/" aria-label="Aberration home" title="Dashboard home">
        <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10 10H38V20H20V54H10ZM44 10H54V54H26V44H44Z"/></svg>
        <span>aberration</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="header-link" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/">Dashboard<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="container hero" aria-labelledby="headline">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Continuous anomaly detection</p>
        <h1 id="headline">Evidence <span>of change.</span></h1>
        <p class="description">Every system has a rhythm. Aberration follows the relationships in your sensor data and brings the moments of change into view.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/">Open dashboard<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#approach">How it works<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14m-6-6 6 6 6-6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">Streaming data. Statistical evidence. A clearer picture.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="pattern-figure">
        <svg class="pattern-art" viewBox="0 0 560 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="pattern-title" aria-describedby="pattern-description">
          <title id="pattern-title">A new shape emerging from a familiar pattern</title>
          <desc id="pattern-description">Fine nested contours form a flowing, organic shape. A teal line departs from their shared rhythm and opens into a new direction.</desc>
          <defs>
            <path id="contour" d="M85 322C33 255 58 147 165 115C252 90 293 161 380 128C474 92 534 149 506 237C479 327 369 355 278 386C193 416 124 378 85 322Z"/>
          </defs>
          <use class="pattern-field" href="#contour"/>
          <g class="pattern-contours">
            <use href="#contour"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.91) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.82) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.73) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.64) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.55) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.46) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.37) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.28) translate(-280 -250)"/>
            <use href="#contour" transform="translate(280 250) scale(.19) translate(-280 -250)"/>
          </g>
          <path class="pattern-change" d="M173 296C129 245 147 192 216 178C284 165 302 217 348 187C391 157 416 93 461 113C510 136 460 218 407 257C364 287 320 302 276 324C232 346 193 327 173 296Z"/>
          <circle class="pattern-halo" cx="461" cy="113" r="12"/>
          <circle class="pattern-point" cx="461" cy="113" r="3.5"/>
        </svg>
        <figcaption class="pattern-caption">Patterns emerge. Change stands out.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
    <section class="approach" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="approach-heading">See the change in context.</h2>
          <p>From connected sensor streams to evidence you can explore, in one continuous workflow.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>
            <div class="step-label"><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>Observe</div>
            <h3>Read the relationships.</h3>
            <p>Bring your sensor streams together. See how measurements behave in relation to one another, beyond individual readings.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="step-label"><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>Calibrate</div>
            <h3>Establish the reference.</h3>
            <p>Learn from baseline data and calibrate anomaly scores with conformal methods. Give new observations a meaningful reference.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="step-label"><span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>Detect</div>
            <h3>Follow the evidence.</h3>
            <p>Accumulate evidence as observations arrive. Explore detected changes alongside the telemetry that explains them.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="container closing" aria-labelledby="closing-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="closing-heading">Your systems, in perspective.</h2>
        <p>Explore your streams and follow the evidence.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/">Open dashboard<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <p>aberration <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Anomaly detection for connected systems.</p>
      <p>Built around evidence.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
